# Zwölferhorn valley station (Talstation): long hall with a low grey
# roof m/d, timber upper walls O/l, a concrete ground floor m/d with the
# entrance, ticket window (b glass) and a dark exit portal, a 2 px l
# timber beam at the floor line; concrete in m/d so it stays darker than
# the stone tiles (D-038). Yellow only on the cabin and the roof sign. The open cable bay on the right
# shows the bull wheel m/i and a parked yellow cabin; the cable leaves to
# the right at row 37 (51 px above the bottom).
# Back-layer prop (layer = "back", D-031): no k, no outlines.
sprite = talstation
size   = 112x88
origin = 56,88
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
